<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Charter One Financial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Charter One Financial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Corp said it initiated coverage of Charter One Financial Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- cited company's proposed deal to acquire RCSB Financial Inc.</p>
<p>-- set a one-year price target of $55 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects Charter One to earn $3.95 a share in 1997 and $4.35 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Charter One lost 3/4 to 46 in afternoon trading.</p>
</text>
